<title>USA: MagCorp cuts pure magnesium price to $1.80/lb.</title>
<headline>MagCorp cuts pure magnesium price to $1.80/lb.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Magnesium Corp of America said its pure magnesium price will be cut to $1.80 per pound from the previous level of $1.93.</p>
<p>The new price will be effective on January 1, 1997, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The list price of magnesium high purity die casting alloys remains unchanged at $1.70 per pound.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities 212-859-1646</p>
